Okuphumayo bhala: ['Test object'], umugqa-omusha.
>> l := Uhlu okusha ; 1 ; ( Uhlu okusha ; (Isikhathi okusha: 1) ; (Int64 kusuka-embhalweni: ['321']) ; (Uhlu okusha ; 3)).
Okuphumayo bhala: l, umugqa-omusha.
>> old-lst-address := l isibonelo-sokuqala ikheli-lenkumbulo.
l save-as: ['/tmp/a.bin'].
Okuphumayo bhala: ['========== RELOADING SNAP:'], umugqa-omusha.
>> b := Into load-from: ['/tmp/a.bin'].
(b isibonelo-sokuqala ikheli-lenkumbulo = old-lst-address) iqiniso: {
	Okuphumayo bhala: ['Object link re-attached.'], umugqa-omusha.
}.
Okuphumayo bhala: b, umugqa-omusha.
